--- 1. Named, Namespace, and Default Imports ---
Namespace escape 1: hello%20world%2Bnodejs
Namespace unescape 1: hello world+nodejs
Namespace escape 2: hello%20world%2Bnodejs
Namespace unescape 2: hello world+nodejs
Default escape: hello%20world%2Bnodejs
Default unescape: hello world+nodejs
Named escape 1: hello%20world%2Bnodejs
Named unescape 1: hello world+nodejs
Named escape 2: hello%20world%2Bnodejs
Named unescape 2: hello world+nodejs
--- 2. Plus and Percent Behavior ---
escaped a+b: a%2Bb
unescaped escapedPlus: a+b
escaped a b: a%20b
unescaped escapedSpace: a b
unescaped a+b (raw): a+b
unescaped a%20b (percent): a b
unescaped a%2Bb (percent): a+b
--- 3. Ignored Trailing Arguments ---
escaped hello: hello
unescaped hello: hello
side effects: EU
